Parts of others that the node uses. None of them is contained in this repository:

- GEM-X code by NVIDIA (github.com/NVlabs/GEM-X), Apache License 2.0. Some of its hand files are under
  OpenMDW-1.1, and the node does not use them. It is a Python dependency at a fixed commit.
- GEM-X Body Pose weights by NVIDIA (Hugging Face nvidia/GEM-X), NVIDIA Open Model License.
  tools/setup.sh downloads them into weights/.
- SOMA body assets by NVIDIA (Hugging Face nvidia/SOMA-X), Apache License 2.0. tools/setup.sh downloads them.
- YOLOX-X HumanArt person detector by OpenMMLab. tools/setup.sh downloads it from OpenMMLab's archive, the one
  GEM-X's instructions name. OpenMMLab states no licence for the model file; it is separate from GEM-X.
